1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Encouraging behavior can inspire a person to take an action they had not previously assumed they were capable of.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
This occurs when you can see a capacity or talent in others that they're unaware of or don't appreciate the value of.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Encouraging also reinforces the other person to take actions that are similar to the action you want him or her to take.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Again, you're reminding the other of something you've admired or appreciated in the past.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Here are a few examples.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:33,000
I look to you as the person to go to for creative ideas on this topic. You're always thinking outside of the box.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:41,000
You're the person I want as my business partner for this project. I have a lot of respect for your ability to think and act strategically.

8
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:49,000
I remember when you were the only person with the courage to stand up to the pressure we were getting about our new process.

9
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
I'm asking you for that kind of support this time.

